{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Golden vectors for the shared per-position risk core. One case is one tick against one position. This file is the contract that binds services/risk/position.py to its TypeScript copy in frontend/src/hooks/useTrailingSL.ts, so that the browser and the server cannot drift apart.",
  "notes": [
    "state uses the snake_case wire shape: the same keys database/scalping_db.py stores and blueprints/scalping.py accepts. A TypeScript consumer maps it with the existing fromBackend helper. Extended keys (trail_mode, trail_trigger) are optional and default to continuous trailing with a trigger of 1.0.",
    "expected is a superset. A consumer asserts only the keys it implements, but every key it does implement must match. The browser copy implements current_sl, highest_price, lowest_price, breached and reason; it does not implement pnl, evaluated, stop_moved or trail_armed.",
    "Numeric comparisons use an absolute tolerance of 1e-6. Several inputs are not exactly representable in binary floating point.",
    "A case carrying a fixes key encodes a defect that the shipped implementations still have. Those cases FAIL against services/scalping_risk_monitor_service.evaluate_trail and against useTrailingSL.evaluateTrail as they stand today, and they are the reason those two must be ported to the shared core. Every case without a fixes key already passes on both.",
    "Reason values are the shipped wire strings: sl, target, or null."
  ],
  "tolerance": 1e-6,
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "long_stop_holds_above_stop",
      "description": "A long above its stop does nothing.",
      "state": {
        "side": "BUY", "entry_price": 100.0, "quantity": 50,
        "initial_sl": 95.0, "current_sl": 95.0, "target": 0.0,
        "trailing_enabled": false, "trailing_step": 0.0,
        "highest_price": 100.0, "lowest_price": 100.0
      },
      "ltp": 95.1,
      "expected": {
        "evaluated": true, "breached": false, "reason": null,
        "current_sl": 95.0, "highest_price": 100.0, "lowest_price": 100.0,
        "stop_moved": false, "trail_armed": false, "pnl": -245.0
      }
    },
